// Keeps the NVIDIA driver out of unattended-upgrades (docs/rebuilding.md, "The GPU driver").
//
// An update of the driver's packages replaces its userspace libraries at once but the kernel module only at the
// next reboot. Until then every new GPU container, Plex's included, fails with "driver/library version mismatch".
// Update the driver by hand in a quiet window and reboot straight after:
//   sudo apt update && sudo apt upgrade && sudo reboot
//
// With the DKMS driver (nvidia-dkms-*), kernel updates still install unattended: DKMS builds the installed
// driver's module for each new kernel. Entries are regular expressions matched against package names.
Unattended-Upgrade::Package-Blacklist {
    "^nvidia-";
    "^libnvidia-";
};
